#slide()[
#text(size: 30pt, weight: "bold")[Exercise]
#v(40pt)
What is the main purpose of Behavioral Finance?
#v(40pt)
// From the start until section one, the option is black. From section 2 until the end it is then turned red, because it is false.
#only("-1")[a) To predict market trends]#only("2-")[#text(fill:red)[a) To predict market trends]]
#v(10pt)
// From the start until section two, the option is black. From section 3 until the end it is then turned green, because it is correct.
#only("-2")[b) To understand irrational financial decisions]#only("3-")[#text(fill:green)[b) To understand irrational financial decisions]]
#v(10pt)
// From the start until section three, the option is black. From section 4 until the end it is then turned red, because it is false.
#only("-3")[c) To calculate financial ratios]#only("4-")[#text(fill:red)[c) To calculate financial ratios]]
#v(10pt)
// From the start until section four, the option is black. From section 5 until the end it is then turned red, because it is false.
#only("-4")[d) To analyze economic policies]#only("5-")[#text(fill:red)[d) To analyze economic policies]]

#only("1")[#voiceover("That's not quite right. Let's look at the correct solution.")]
#only("2")[#voiceover("Option a) To predict market trends is incorrect. While behavioral finance insights can inform market analysis, its primary purpose is not prediction.")]
#only("3")[#voiceover("Option b) To understand irrational financial decisions is the correct answer. Behavioral finance aims to explain why investors often make decisions that deviate from rationality.")]
#only("4")[#voiceover("Option c) To calculate financial ratios is incorrect. Behavioral finance is not focused on quantitative financial analysis.")]
#only("5")[#voiceover("Option d) To analyze economic policies is also incorrect. While behavioral insights can inform policy, it's not the main purpose of the field.")]
]

#slide()[
#text(size: 30pt, weight: "bold")[Solution]
#v(40pt)
#only("1-")[The main purpose of Behavioral Finance is to:]
#v(20pt)
#only("2-")[- Understand and explain why investors often make irrational financial decisions 🧠💰]
#v(20pt)
#only("3-")[Behavioral Finance focuses on:]
#v(20pt)
#only("4-")[- How psychological influences and biases affect financial behavior 🌈🧠]
#v(20pt)
#only("5-")[- Explaining deviations from rational decision-making in finance 📈🤔]

#only("1")[#voiceover("Let's break down the solution.")]
#only("2")[#voiceover("The primary aim of behavioral finance is to understand and explain why investors frequently make financial decisions that are irrational.")]
#only("3")[#voiceover("The field focuses on how various psychological factors and biases influence financial behavior.")]
#only("4")[#voiceover("It seeks to shed light on the psychological underpinnings that lead to irrational financial choices.")]
#only("5")[#voiceover("In essence, behavioral finance aims to explain why actual financial decision-making often deviates from the rational ideal assumed in traditional finance theories.")]
]

